{"id":"2e7d619feee516bd","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-iteration-limit.md","title":"闭包之后的所有已定义阶段保持固定","display":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 闭包之后的所有已定义阶段保持固定","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-iteration-limit","aliases":["91-cor-truth-iteration-limit","91-cor-iteration-limit"],"display":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 闭包之后的所有已定义阶段保持固定","depends_on":["[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]","[[91-df-iterative-construction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-iteration-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-iteration-limit</span><span>91-cor-iteration-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-iteration-limit — 闭包之后的所有已定义阶段保持固定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78700f82584ead6\" href=\"?note=b78700f82584ead6\" title=\"91-thm-iteration-convergence\">91-thm-iteration-convergence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adf7b5cbd73dbafa\" href=\"?note=adf7b5cbd73dbafa\" title=\"91-df-iterative-construction\">91-df-iterative-construction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 单调；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 为一给定序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\le\\eta}\">\\((X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\le\\eta}\\)</span> 为从空集出发的后继跳跃、非零极限取并递归。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\eta\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}\">\\(X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\)</span> 为极小固定点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\nX_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\qquad\n\\forall\\beta\\ (\\kappa\\le\\beta\\le\\eta\\to X_\\beta=X_\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\nX_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\qquad\n\\forall\\beta\\ (\\kappa\\le\\beta\\le\\eta\\to X_\\beta=X_\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对已定义阶段作超限归纳：后继因固定点不变，极限因较早阶段均包含于 X_κ 且闭包后阶段恒等，取并仍得 X_κ。极小性用从空集到任意预固定集的逐阶段包含证明。\n原稿对所有未给长度的 β 量化，混入未声明的真类序列，现以集合长 η 指定范围。闭包阶段的存在由 Hartogs 论证，既不要求 Scott 连续，也不是句法 T^n 的分析极限。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1 的极小固定点迭代；上游 Hartogs 停止定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-iterative-construction","status":"resolved","id":"adf7b5cbd73dbafa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-iterative-construction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"(X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\le\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\kappa=X_{\\kappa+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\nX_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\qquad\n\\forall\\beta\\ (\\kappa\\le\\beta\\le\\eta\\to X_\\beta=X_\\kappa).","display":true}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-iteration-limit]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-iteration-limit]]"}],"outgoing":["b78700f82584ead6","adf7b5cbd73dbafa"]}